<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of weekend matches</p>
<p>in the Argentine Clausura championship:</p>
<p> Colon			5    River Plate		  1</p>
<p> Boca Juniors	     6    Gimnasia-La Plata	  1</p>
<p> Rosario Central	  0    Velez Sarsfield	    1</p>
<p> Platense		   0    Independiente		3</p>
<p> Lanus			1    Huracan Corrientes	 2</p>
<p> Deportivo Espanol	2    Union			  1  </p>
<p> Huracan		    1    Banfield		     0</p>
